WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.752 --> 00:00:15.255
"Trolls!" Perda hissed in Zann's ear.

2
00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:17.716
The four friends hid behind a hedge.

3
00:00:17.736 --> 00:00:21.057
"I haven't seen a troll in First City since Morb was defeated!"

4
00:00:21.397 --> 00:00:22.057
Zann whispered.

5
00:00:22.717 --> 00:00:24.057
Darb peeked through the hedge.

6
00:00:24.077 --> 00:00:26.318
"Laddno just came outside."

7
00:00:27.298 --> 00:00:30.399
Zann watched in shock as Laddno talked to the trolls.

8
00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:33.800
Zann was too far to hear what the man was saying.

9
00:00:34.444 --> 00:00:37.165
But he could hear the trolls' loud grunts in response.

10
00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:41.307
"Forget about trying to see your families," Perda murmured.

11
00:00:42.027 --> 00:00:43.168
"It's not safe here."

12
00:00:44.888 --> 00:00:46.449
They returned to Teplo's house.

13
00:00:47.209 --> 00:00:49.790
Zing was flapping around, shooting flames everywhere.

14
00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:52.191
"Why is he so excited?"

15
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:53.032
Perda asked.

16
00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:56.333
"He's probably just happy to see us," Zann said.

17
00:00:56.353 --> 00:00:59.535
"I hope Fala didn't get captured," Darb said.

18
00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:02.556
"What if Zing was trapped here while we were gone?"

19
00:01:03.384 --> 00:01:07.426
Teplo's pet sniffer goose waddled into sight, honking with displeasure.

20
00:01:07.446 --> 00:01:10.628
"Zing's food looks fresh," Perda said.

21
00:01:10.648 --> 00:01:13.230
"That must mean Fala has been here recently."

22
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.451
"Good." Zann summoned a message moth.

23
00:01:16.471 --> 00:01:18.192
"I'll let her know we're back."

24
00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.275
Moments later Fala zapped into view.

25
00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:24.916
"You've returned!"

26
00:01:25.236 --> 00:01:25.696
she cried.

27
00:01:25.716 --> 00:01:27.938
"I was starting to worry about you."

28
00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:29.718
"How's my uncle?"

29
00:01:29.939 --> 00:01:30.619
Gliss asked.

30
00:01:30.639 --> 00:01:32.220
"And Zann's family?"

31
00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:33.773
"They're fine."

32
00:01:34.213 --> 00:01:37.736
Fala handed Gliss the Remote Eye so Gliss could see for herself.

33
00:01:38.617 --> 00:01:39.838
"Now tell me about your trip.

34
00:01:40.238 --> 00:01:41.199
Did you find Morb?"

35
00:01:41.999 --> 00:01:45.342
Gliss peered through the Eye and then handed it to Zann.

36
00:01:46.043 --> 00:01:50.486
He looked through it and saw his parents, Boz, and the others sitting in their cells.

37
00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.027
They looked okay.

38
00:01:52.047 --> 00:01:54.930
"We found Morb," Perda said.

39
00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.492
"We have a lot to tell you."

40
00:01:58.353 --> 00:02:00.794
The kids described their trip to the Far Frontier.

41
00:02:01.555 --> 00:02:04.165
The more they talked, the more worried Fala looked.

42
00:02:04.185 --> 00:02:06.567
"Oh, dear," she said.

43
00:02:06.587 --> 00:02:10.389
"So it's true—Morb really is up to no good."

44
00:02:10.409 --> 00:02:13.431
"As usual," Perda said grimly.

45
00:02:13.451 --> 00:02:15.012
"But that's not all.

46
00:02:15.653 --> 00:02:19.315
We were just at the palace, and we saw a bunch of trolls in the square!"

47
00:02:19.335 --> 00:02:21.677
"Yes." Fala nodded.

48
00:02:22.297 --> 00:02:24.879
"Laddno brought them to the palace a couple of days ago.

49
00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:28.902
He's using them as bodyguards."

50
00:02:28.922 --> 00:02:30.043
"Why?" Gliss asked.

51
00:02:30.863 --> 00:02:31.624
Fala shrugged.

52
00:02:32.436 --> 00:02:36.300
"He claims he needs them because his life has been threatened."

53
00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.841
"Who threatened him?"

54
00:02:38.281 --> 00:02:38.902
Zann asked.

55
00:02:38.922 --> 00:02:42.065
"He won't give any details," Fala said.

56
00:02:42.085 --> 00:02:46.088
"He also won't explain how he's controlling the trolls."

57
00:02:46.969 --> 00:02:48.710
Zann traded a look with his friends.

58
00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.434
"What if Morb is the one who's threatening Laddno?"

59
00:02:52.674 --> 00:02:53.214
Perda said.

60
00:02:54.075 --> 00:02:55.696
Zann had been thinking the same thing.

61
00:02:55.716 --> 00:02:59.580
"Laddno might remember that Morb used trolls once," he said.

62
00:03:00.328 --> 00:03:02.830
"Maybe Laddno thinks he can use them to stop Morb."

63
00:03:03.531 --> 00:03:05.312
A message moth fluttered into the room.

64
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:06.713
It was from Mari.

65
00:03:07.494 --> 00:03:11.257
"She wants to know why we disappeared so suddenly earlier," Zann told his friends.

66
00:03:12.118 --> 00:03:15.040
He started to write a response, but Fala stopped him.

67
00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:19.283
"It's better to keep your movements quiet," Fala said.

68
00:03:19.303 --> 00:03:21.925
"At least until after the election."

69
00:03:21.945 --> 00:03:24.728
"Okay." Zann stared at the moth.

70
00:03:25.568 --> 00:03:27.770
Thinking about Mari gave him an idea.

71
00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.872
"Let's go to my parents' lab.

72
00:03:30.644 --> 00:03:33.386
Maybe we can get some ideas there about ways to stop Morb."

73
00:03:33.406 --> 00:03:35.728
"Good idea," Perda agreed.

74
00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:38.190
"Don't tell Mari we're going, though.

75
00:03:38.671 --> 00:03:41.613
As Fala said, we should keep our movements quiet."

76
00:03:42.414 --> 00:03:44.876
"We have to tell Mari," Zann insisted.

77
00:03:44.896 --> 00:03:47.338
"She told us there's a spell on the lab.

78
00:03:47.638 --> 00:03:49.179
We won't be able to get past it without her."

79
00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:50.821
"What spell?"

80
00:03:51.341 --> 00:03:52.582
Fala sounded surprised.

81
00:03:53.303 --> 00:03:56.145
They told her what Mari had revealed about the Security spell.

82
00:03:56.165 --> 00:03:59.688
"She said Venna helped her with it," Gliss said.

83
00:04:00.508 --> 00:04:03.730
"Venna didn't mention anything about that to me," Fala said.

84
00:04:04.671 --> 00:04:05.532
She looked at Zann.

85
00:04:05.552 --> 00:04:07.553
"But go ahead and contact her."

86
00:04:08.954 --> 00:04:10.635
Zann quickly inscribed the moth.

87
00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:12.477
"Okay," he said.

88
00:04:12.497 --> 00:04:13.597
"Let's go."

89
00:04:13.617 --> 00:04:15.459
"Are you coming, Fala?"

90
00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:16.439
Perda asked.

91
00:04:16.459 --> 00:04:19.201
"I'll meet up with you later," she replied.

92
00:04:19.221 --> 00:04:21.543
"I want to check on Venna again.

93
00:04:22.043 --> 00:04:23.724
She's received some threats too.

94
00:04:24.165 --> 00:04:26.346
But she refuses to go into hiding."

95
00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:29.532
Zann whistled for Zing.

96
00:04:29.552 --> 00:04:32.554
Then he and his friends zapped to the street outside the lab.

97
00:04:33.215 --> 00:04:36.137
To his surprise, Mari was already waiting for them.

98
00:04:37.198 --> 00:04:39.039
"You got here fast," Zann said.

99
00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:40.760
Mari smiled.

100
00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.463
"I was on my way here to check on the relics when I got your moth."

101
00:04:45.323 --> 00:04:48.045
"What kind of Security spell did you put on this place?"

102
00:04:48.465 --> 00:04:49.066
Perda asked.

103
00:04:49.086 --> 00:04:51.808
"A special kind of Shield spell."

104
00:04:52.388 --> 00:04:53.789
Mari rubbed her hands together.

105
00:04:53.809 --> 00:04:55.350
"It's pretty cool."

106
00:04:56.091 --> 00:04:59.641
She explained how the spell worked, though Zann didn't pay much attention.

107
00:05:00.521 --> 00:05:04.322
He just wanted to get inside the lab and figure out how to stop Morb.

108
00:05:07.143 --> 00:05:09.963
But once inside, Zann wasn't sure where to start.

109
00:05:10.704 --> 00:05:13.144
Mari wandered into the back to check on the relics.

110
00:05:14.005 --> 00:05:15.125
Zann looked at his friends.

111
00:05:15.145 --> 00:05:18.986
"Let's just look around for anything that might be useful," he whispered.

112
00:05:19.646 --> 00:05:23.147
He wanted to trust Mari, but he remembered Fala's warning.

113
00:05:23.827 --> 00:05:25.488
Perda was already opening record books.

114
00:05:26.168 --> 00:05:28.889
"This one's about the Mask of Zanta," she said.

115
00:05:28.909 --> 00:05:33.090
"The relic is gone, but your parents wrote a lot about it."

116
00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:34.890
She scanned the page.

117
00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:40.832
"Mostly about its immense power and its connection to the very early days of Magica history."

118
00:05:41.892 --> 00:05:43.393
Zann bent closer to see.

119
00:05:44.053 --> 00:05:45.593
Something in his pocket poked him.

120
00:05:46.354 --> 00:05:49.715
He reached in and pulled out the twigs he'd collected on Atmo.

121
00:05:50.435 --> 00:05:52.075
Mari came back into the room.

122
00:05:52.095 --> 00:05:53.876
"What are those?"

123
00:05:54.844 --> 00:05:56.966
"I found them in another world," Zann said.

124
00:05:56.986 --> 00:05:59.768
"They're supposed to contain lots of magic energy."

125
00:06:00.489 --> 00:06:01.630
"From another world?"

126
00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.331
Mari stepped closer.

127
00:06:03.351 --> 00:06:06.674
"Cool. I bet my uncle would love to see those!"

128
00:06:07.815 --> 00:06:09.636
"Why would your uncle want to see them?"

129
00:06:09.876 --> 00:06:10.557
Gliss asked.

130
00:06:11.318 --> 00:06:13.259
Suddenly Mari looked uncomfortable.

131
00:06:13.279 --> 00:06:16.422
"He's a, um, researcher."

132
00:06:17.222 --> 00:06:18.303
Zann was confused.

133
00:06:18.984 --> 00:06:23.808
If Mari's uncle was a researcher, why had she been so eager to work for his parents?

134
00:06:24.576 --> 00:06:25.838
He opened his mouth to ask.

135
00:06:26.159 --> 00:06:30.747
But at that moment, the entrance to the lab flew open and several trolls burst in!
